{"seq":2,"slug":"lpvr-bounce-postclick-metric","title":"落地页访问转化率 LPVR/跳出度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/postclick-landing-page-cro/postclick-attribution-cro/lpvr-bounce-postclick-metric","wordCount":2250,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"落地页访问转化率-lpvr-跳出度量\">落地页访问转化率 LPVR/跳出度量</h1><p>上一篇讲的是分子——一次转化该归给谁。这一篇讲分母——什么算一次「有效的落地访问」。分母的定义决定了指标能不能用：如果机器人流量、误触、以及被同意闸门挡住的会话都被算进分母，LPVR 会被人为压低，团队会去优化一个失真的数字；反之若把失败会话都剔除，指标会虚高并掩盖真实问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-lpvr-的定义与分母口径\">核心概念：LPVR 的定义与分母口径</h2><p>落地页访问转化率（Landing Page View Rate，LPVR，也常写作 LPVR）的一般形式是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>LPVR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>该落地页产生的转化数</mtext><mtext>该落地页的有效访问数</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{LPVR} = \\frac{\\text{该落地页产生的转化数}}{\\text{该落地页的有效访问数}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LPVR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">该落地页的有效访问数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">该落地页产生的转化数</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>分子的定义相对稳定（转化事件），分母则是全部争议所在。分母要回答三个问题：谁算访客、多少次算一次、哪些会话应当被排除。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三个问题的处理方式\">三个问题的处理方式</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>倾向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>谁算访客</td>\n<td>会话 / 用户 / 设备</td>\n<td>按会话更贴近实验粒度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多次访问</td>\n<td>每次计入 / 去重</td>\n<td>按归因窗口内首次或末次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排除项</td>\n<td>机器人、误触、同意拒绝、内部流量</td>\n<td>分别处理，不合并</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「分别处理、不合并」是关键的工程原则：把四类排除项混成一个 <code>excluded</code> 标志，会让后续无法回答「有多少损失来自合规」。它们应当被分别标记并在报表中分层可见。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE landing_sessions (&#10;  session_ref     TEXT        PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  landing_id      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  landing_variant VARCHAR(64),&#10;  market          VARCHAR(8),&#10;  device_class    VARCHAR(16),&#10;  entered_at      TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  first_screen_ms INTEGER,&#10;  engaged         BOOLEAN     NOT NULL DEFAULT false,&#10;  bot_flag        BOOLEAN     NOT NULL DEFAULT false,&#10;  accidental_flag BOOLEAN     NOT NULL DEFAULT false,&#10;  consent_state   VARCHAR(16) NOT NULL DEFAULT &#39;unknown&#39;,&#10;  internal_flag   BOOLEAN     NOT NULL DEFAULT false,&#10;  exit_reason     VARCHAR(32)&#10;);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_ls_lp_time ON landing_sessions (landing_id, entered_at);&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_ls_variant ON landing_sessions (landing_variant, entered_at)&#10;  WHERE bot_flag = false AND internal_flag = false;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> landing_sessions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  session_ref     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  landing_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  landing_variant </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  device_class    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entered_at      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  first_screen_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  engaged         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  bot_flag        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  accidental_flag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  consent_state   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">16</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'unknown'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  internal_flag   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  exit_reason     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_ls_lp_time</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> landing_sessions (landing_id, entered_at);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_ls_variant</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> landing_sessions (landing_variant, entered_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bot_flag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> internal_flag </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> false;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>排除项应当是<strong>标记而非删除</strong>。删除会永久失去审计能力，而标记让任何人都能用不同的排除组合重算指标——这在口径争议时是唯一可行的仲裁方式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"lpvr-的标准查询\">LPVR 的标准查询</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;  s.landing_id,&#10;  s.landing_variant,&#10;  s.market,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE NOT s.bot_flag&#10;                     AND NOT s.internal_flag&#10;                     AND s.consent_state &lt;&gt; &#39;denied_measurement&#39;)       AS eligible_sessions,&#10;  COUNT(DISTINCT s.session_ref) FILTER (WHERE c.id IS NOT NULL)          AS converting_sessions,&#10;  ROUND(&#10;    COUNT(DISTINCT s.session_ref) FILTER (WHERE c.id IS NOT NULL)::numeric&#10;    / NULLIF(COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE NOT s.bot_flag&#10;                                AND NOT s.internal_flag&#10;                                AND s.consent_state &lt;&gt; &#39;denied_measurement&#39;), 0)&#10;  , 4)                                                                   AS lpvr,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE s.bot_flag)                                     AS bots,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE s.accidental_flag)                              AS accidental,&#10;  COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE s.consent_state = &#39;denied_measurement&#39;)         AS blocked_by_consent&#10;FROM landing_sessions s&#10;LEFT JOIN conversions c ON c.session_ref = s.session_ref AND c.status = &#39;confirmed&#39;&#10;WHERE s.entered_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;7 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY s.landing_id, s.landing_variant, s.market&#10;ORDER BY eligible_sessions DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">landing_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">landing_variant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bot_flag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                     AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">internal_flag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                     AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">consent_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'denied_measurement'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eligible_sessions,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">session_ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)          </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> converting_sessions,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">session_ref</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IS NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NULLIF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bot_flag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                AND</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">internal_flag</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">consent_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'denied_measurement'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  , </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                                                   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lpvr,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bot_flag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> bots,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">accidental_flag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                              </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accidental,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">consent_state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'denied_measurement'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> blocked_by_consent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> landing_sessions s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> conversions c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">session_ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">session_ref</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">status</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'confirmed'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">entered_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'7 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">landing_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">landing_variant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">s</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">market</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> eligible_sessions </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>blocked_by_consent</code> 与 <code>eligible_sessions</code> 的分母定义了两次「同意拒绝」：它在排除项里被剔除，同时作为一个独立计数被报告出来。这样团队能看到「有多少流量因为合规原因不可测」，而不是让这部分流量静默消失。</p>\n<h2 id=\"机器人-误触与内部流量的识别\">机器人、误触与内部流量的识别</h2><h3 id=\"机器人\">机器人</h3><p>落地页的广告流量中，机器人的主要来源是平台自己的抓取器（用于校验落地页，见 <a href=\"ad-claim-landing-compliance\">广告宣称与落地页合规一致</a>）与第三方监测。识别信号包括：User-Agent 白名单匹配已知抓取器、请求间无静态资源加载、无鼠标/触摸事件、以及同一 IP 高频请求。<strong>不要用「停留时间极短」单独判定机器人</strong>——弱网下真实用户的首屏停留也可能极短，这个信号应当与资源加载模式联合使用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"误触\">误触</h3><p>移动端误触在社交渠道的流量中占比可观：用户滑动信息流时误点广告，落地页只被加载了几百毫秒就被返回。这类会话的特征是首屏几乎未被看到就已离开。识别方式是用可见性 API 记录首屏实际可见时长，低于阈值且无任何滚动的会话标记为误触。</p>\n<h3 id=\"内部流量\">内部流量</h3><p>团队自己的测试访问必须排除，且不能只靠 IP 白名单（跨境团队成员的出口 IP 分布在多国且动态）。更可靠的做法是给内部访问打一个显式的标记 Cookie，并让该标记在构建与测试流程中自动注入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跳出率的新定义\">跳出率的新定义</h2><p>跨境团队常把「跳出率」当作落地页的核心健康指标，但 GA4 改变了它的定义，导致跨版本不可比。</p>\n<p>GA4 中跳出率被定义为<strong>未参与会话占全部会话的比例</strong>，是参与率的补数。而「参与会话」需满足以下三者之一 <a href=\"https://support.google.com/analytics/answer/12195621\">GA4 跳出率与参与率</a>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>会话持续时间<strong>超过 10 秒</strong>；或</li>\n<li>会话中发生了关键事件；或</li>\n<li>会话中包含<strong>2 次或以上</strong>的页面/屏幕浏览。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此一个停留 30 秒但只看了单页的会话，在 GA4 里<strong>不算跳出</strong>——这在 Universal Analytics 的「单页且无交互即为跳出」定义下是完全相反的。文档同时指出 <code>first_visit</code>、<code>first_open</code>、<code>session_start</code> 即使被标记为关键事件也不计入参与会话。另外这两个指标默认不出现在多数报表中，需由编辑者或管理员添加到明细报表，且无法加到概览报表。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三个定义差异的对照\">三个定义差异的对照</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>情形</th>\n<th>UA 口径</th>\n<th>GA4 口径</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单页停留 5 秒，无事件</td>\n<td>跳出</td>\n<td>跳出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单页停留 30 秒，无事件</td>\n<td>跳出</td>\n<td>不算跳出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单页停留 3 秒，触发关键事件</td>\n<td>不算跳出</td>\n<td>不算跳出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>双页浏览共 2 秒</td>\n<td>不算跳出</td>\n<td>不算跳出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>对落地页运营的三条实际影响：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>与历史数据不可比</strong>。任何跨越 GA4 迁移的跳出率趋势都是伪趋势。</li>\n<li><strong>跳出率不再等价于「没兴趣」</strong>。一个 11 秒的单页会话不算跳出，但它可能确实是无效流量。</li>\n<li><strong>落地页应当自定义指标</strong>。GA4 的通用跳出定义对落地页太宽松，应当用「是否发生首屏交互或滚动」这类页面级信号自建有效访问口径。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"自建有效访问判定\">自建有效访问判定</h3><p>落地页需要的「有效访问」比 GA4 的参与会话更严格——它要排除误触与机器人，而不是仅仅判断停留时长。可行的判定规则：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def classify_session(s) -&gt; str:&#10;    if s.ua_matches_known_crawler or s.asset_requests == 0:&#10;        return &quot;bot&quot;&#10;    if s.first_screen_visible_ms is None or s.first_screen_visible_ms &lt; 400:&#10;        return &quot;accidental&quot;          # 首屏几乎未被看到&#10;    if s.internal_marker_cookie:&#10;        return &quot;internal&quot;&#10;    if s.consent_state == &quot;denied_measurement&quot;:&#10;        return &quot;unmeasurable&quot;        # 合规阻断，不是无效流量&#10;    if s.max_scroll_pct &gt; 5 or s.first_interaction_ms is not None:&#10;        return &quot;engaged_valid&quot;&#10;    return &quot;valid_no_interaction&quot;    # 计入分母，但不计入参与\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> classify_session</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(s) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.ua_matches_known_crawler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.asset_requests </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"bot\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.first_screen_visible_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.first_screen_visible_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"accidental\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # 首屏几乎未被看到</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.internal_marker_cookie:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"internal\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.consent_state </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"denied_measurement\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"unmeasurable\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 合规阻断，不是无效流量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.max_scroll_pct </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> or</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> s.first_interaction_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">is</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"engaged_valid\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"valid_no_interaction\"</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 计入分母，但不计入参与</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个分类把「无效」与「不可测」分开：<code>unmeasurable</code> 并非无效流量，它只是因合规原因无法被观测，因此必须单独报告而不是并入无效流量——否则会低估真实访问量并误判页面表现。它与同意率的联动见 <a href=\"../landing-performance-friction/landing-privacy-cookie-consent\">Cookie 横幅/隐私同意与转化平衡</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"漏斗分解与监控\">漏斗分解与监控</h2><p>单一 LPVR 数字无法定位问题。有效的做法是把落地页到转化的路径拆成若干可分别度量的步骤，并对每一步做分位数监控。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[广告点击] --&gt; B[落地页请求到达]&#10;  B --&gt; C[首屏可见]&#10;  C --&gt; D[首次交互&lt;br/&gt;滚动/点击]&#10;  D --&gt; E[进入商品或加购]&#10;  E --&gt; F[进入结算]&#10;  F --&gt; G[提交订单]&#10;  G --&gt; H[支付完成]&#10;  B --&gt; I[误触/机器人&lt;br/&gt;标记排除]&#10;  C --&gt; J[首屏后离开]&#10;  D --&gt; K[加购前离开]&#10;  F --&gt; L[结算放弃]\">graph TD\n  A[广告点击] --&gt; B[落地页请求到达]\n  B --&gt; C[首屏可见]\n  C --&gt; D[首次交互&lt;br/&gt;滚动/点击]\n  D --&gt; E[进入商品或加购]\n  E --&gt; F[进入结算]\n  F --&gt; G[提交订单]\n  G --&gt; H[支付完成]\n  B --&gt; I[误触/机器人&lt;br/&gt;标记排除]\n  C --&gt; J[首屏后离开]\n  D --&gt; K[加购前离开]\n  F --&gt; L[结算放弃]</pre><p>每一步的比率都有独立的诊断价值：首屏可见率低指向性能（见 <a href=\"../landing-performance-friction/landing-speed-mobile-webvitals\">落地页极速加载与移动 Web Vitals</a>），首屏到首次交互的流失指向一致性（见 <a href=\"../landing-message-relevance/message-match-creative-audience\">message match 与广告/受众一致性</a>），结算放弃指向表单与税运费透明（见 <a href=\"../landing-performance-friction/form-checkout-prefill-friction\">表单/注册/结算前置与少摩擦</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用分位数而非均值监控\">用分位数而非均值监控</h3><p>落地页的转化时间分布是长尾的，均值会被少数慢转化拉偏。可行的监控方式是对每一步的<strong>耗时与流失</strong>分别看分位数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>关注的统计量</th>\n<th>告警条件示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>首屏可见耗时</td>\n<td>p75 / p95</td>\n<td>p75 超过 2.5 s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首屏到首次交互</td>\n<td>p50 / p75</td>\n<td>p50 上升 20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>各步骤流失率</td>\n<td>比率</td>\n<td>相对上一周期上升 15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算放弃率</td>\n<td>比率</td>\n<td>分层（新客/老客）后分别看</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>分位数监控的关键是<strong>按设备与市场分层</strong>。全局 p75 良好不代表移动端低端设备良好，而后者才是跨境投放的主力流量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个易被忽略的指标-可测率\">一个易被忽略的指标：可测率</h3><p>当同意拒绝率较高时，LPVR 的分母会显著小于真实访问量，此时指标的可信度依赖于被剔除部分与保留部分是否同质。<strong>可测率</strong>（可测会话 / 总会话）因此是一个必须与 LPVR 一起看的指标：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>可测率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>eligible_sessions</mtext><mrow><mtext>eligible_sessions</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>blocked_by_consent</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可测率} = \\frac{\\text{eligible\\_sessions}}{\\text{eligible\\_sessions} + \\text{blocked\\_by\\_consent}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可测率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3904em;vertical-align:-0.996em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3944em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eligible_sessions</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">blocked_by_consent</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">eligible_sessions</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.996em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若某市场的可测率从 85% 掉到 60%，LPVR 的任何变化都应当先怀疑是样本结构变化而不是真实效果。同意状态与实验分层的耦合见 <a href=\"../landing-performance-friction/landing-privacy-cookie-consent\">Cookie 横幅/隐私同意与转化平衡</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>LPVR 是点击后优化的目标指标，它的可信度完全取决于分母定义。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分母定义决定指标可用性</strong>：谁算访客、多少次算一次、排除哪些会话，三个问题必须显式回答。</li>\n<li><strong>排除项标记而非删除</strong>：分别标记机器人与误触、同意拒绝、内部流量，让口径争议可以重算仲裁。</li>\n<li><strong>同意拒绝要单独报告</strong>：它既进排除项也进独立计数，团队才能看到合规造成的可测性缺口。</li>\n<li><strong>误触要用可见性判定</strong>：停留时间短不等于机器人，弱网下真实用户也会很快离开。</li>\n<li><strong>GA4 跳出率定义已变</strong>：参与门槛是 &gt;10 秒、有关键事件、或 ≥2 次浏览，单页 30 秒不算跳出，与 UA 口径相反。</li>\n<li><strong>落地页应自建有效访问口径</strong>：GA4 的通用定义对落地页过于宽松，用首屏交互或滚动作为页面级信号更贴近真实。</li>\n<li><strong>分位数 + 分层</strong>：按设备与市场分层看 p75/p95，全局均值会掩盖移动端低端设备的真实体验。</li>\n<li><strong>可测率必须与 LPVR 同看</strong>：可测率骤降时，LPVR 的变化应先怀疑样本结构而非真实效果。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>下一步：指标与归因就绪后，还要确保优化动作不越过平台政策的线，见 <a href=\"ad-claim-landing-compliance\">广告宣称与落地页合规一致</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"落地页访问转化率 LPVR/跳出度量","id":"落地页访问转化率-lpvr-跳出度量"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：LPVR 的定义与分母口径","id":"核心概念-lpvr-的定义与分母口径"},{"level":3,"text":"三个问题的处理方式","id":"三个问题的处理方式"},{"level":3,"text":"LPVR 的标准查询","id":"lpvr-的标准查询"},{"level":2,"text":"机器人、误触与内部流量的识别","id":"机器人-误触与内部流量的识别"},{"level":3,"text":"机器人","id":"机器人"},{"level":3,"text":"误触","id":"误触"},{"level":3,"text":"内部流量","id":"内部流量"},{"level":2,"text":"跳出率的新定义","id":"跳出率的新定义"},{"level":3,"text":"三个定义差异的对照","id":"三个定义差异的对照"},{"level":3,"text":"自建有效访问判定","id":"自建有效访问判定"},{"level":2,"text":"漏斗分解与监控","id":"漏斗分解与监控"},{"level":3,"text":"用分位数而非均值监控","id":"用分位数而非均值监控"},{"level":3,"text":"一个易被忽略的指标：可测率","id":"一个易被忽略的指标-可测率"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"投放-落地-转化漏斗归因","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/postclick-landing-page-cro/postclick-attribution-cro/ad-landing-conversion-attribution"},"next":{"title":"广告宣称与落地页合规一致","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/postclick-landing-page-cro/postclick-attribution-cro/ad-claim-landing-compliance"}}